OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Labour deputy leader Tom Watson
OL,4,Ajoins Palantir
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer cabinet minister and Labour
OL,7,FParty deputy leader Lord Tom Watson has
OL,8,Fbecome a senior vice president at US
OL,9,Ftech firm Palantir.
OL,11,FAnnouncing his appointment on X, Lord
OL,12,FWatson said Palantir was "the most
OL,13,Finteresting company on the planet,
OL,14,Fdoing work of real consequence".
OL,16,FHe said the company had "challenges"
OL,17,Fand that while some criticism was
OL,18,F"propaganda" there were "legitimate
OL,19,Fquestions about large technology
OL,20,Fcompanies and sovereign control".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
