OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Labour deputy leader Tom Watson
OL,4,Ajoins Palantir
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen MP Sian Berry said: "This is yet
OL,7,Fanother example of the corrosive
OL,8,Frevolving door between politics and big
OL,9,Fbusiness lobbying that has no place in
OL,10,Fpublic life."
